    "code": "unsigned long redAt = 0;\nunsigned long greenAt = 0;\nbool red = false;\nbool green = false;\nint previous = HIGH;\nint presses = 0;\nvoid setup() { Serial.begin(115200); pinMode(9, OUTPUT); pinMode(10, OUTPUT); pinMode(2, INPUT_PULLUP); }\nvoid loop() {\n  unsigned long now = millis();\n  if (now - redAt >= 200) { redAt = now; red = !red; digitalWrite(9, red); }\n  if (now - greenAt >= 350) { greenAt = now; green = !green; digitalWrite(10, green); }\n  int reading = digitalRead(2);\n  if (reading == LOW && previous == HIGH) { presses++; Serial.print(\"PRESS=\"); Serial.println(presses); }\n  previous = reading;\n}\n",
